The PGCU model reframes the ontology of cosmology:

\begin{itemize}
  \item \textbf{Expansion is not motion}, but the increasing ease of resolving structure.
  \item \textbf{Mass is not matter}, but the angular delay in projection.
  \item \textbf{Time is not a dimension}, but a surfacing of structure across link-based resistance.
\end{itemize}

\noindent This module thus completes the cosmological arc of SAT by showing that all dynamics — local and global — arise from the geometry of projection through structure.

